{"requiredConsciousReasoning":"Hypothesis 1: Color transformation observed in g@train1, g@train2, g@train3. Validation results show that the color transformation does not consistently apply across all training examples. In g@train1, the color 7 was transformed to 5, but in g@train3, the color 7 remained unchanged in some instances. Therefore, this hypothesis is partially valid, scoring 1 out of 3. 

Hypothesis 2: Object expansion inconsistencies in g@train1 and g@train3. The object expansion was applied to both grids, but the results did not match the expected outputs in both cases. Thus, this hypothesis is invalid, scoring 0 out of 3. 

Hypothesis 3: Edge cluster expansion validated in g@train1, g@train2, g@train3. The edge cluster expansion was applied, and the results matched the expected outputs in all cases. Therefore, this hypothesis is valid, scoring 3 out of 3.","activations":[{"neuronNames":["hypothesis-generator"],"tasks":["Task: Validate hypotheses against training examples","Expected: Document matches and mismatches for each hypothesis"],"context":["Hypothesis 1: Color transformation observed in g@train1, g@train2, g@train3. Score: 1/3","Hypothesis 2: Object expansion inconsistencies in g@train1 and g@train3. Score: 0/3","Hypothesis 3: Edge cluster expansion validated in g@train1, g@train2, g@train3. Score: 3/3"]}]}
